{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53416","headline":"新池 · 白元鉴","name":"新池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔尝游胜境，今喜尽幽踪。\n丹满镜潭色，云疏锦碛容。\n响中闻细溜，波里见乔松。\n唯广花源赏，人间不可逢。\n（同前第二○四三页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白元鉴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}